# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC JVM CA trust (self-signed TLS only):** when `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, the backend command (in `templates/compose.yml.j2`) imports the internal CA into a writable `cacerts` copy and points the JVM at it via `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. The shared `with-ca-trust.sh` entrypoint covers the OS/NSS/env trust stores but not the JVM truststore, so without this Penpot's server-side OIDC token/userinfo calls to Keycloak fail with `PKIX path building failed`. The override is gated behind self-signed mode (it is a no-op in production, where real CA-signed certs are already trusted) and the CA path is hardcoded because the framework's CA-override re-serialises the command."
msgstr "**OIDC JVM CA信托基金 (仅自签名 TLS)数字 :** 何时 `TLS_MODE == self_signed`, 后端命令 (内 `templates/compose.yml.j2`) 将内部 CA 导入为可写 `cacerts` 复制并标注 JVM通过 `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS`. 共享 `with-ca-trust.sh` 进入点包括: OS/NSS/env 信托商店,但不是JVM信托, 所以没有这个 Penpot服务器侧 OIDC 令牌/ 用户信息呼叫 Keycloak 失败 `PKIX path building failed`。该超载在自签名模式后加门 (已信任真实的 CA 签名证书, 这是生产中的禁用) 而CA路径是硬编码的,因为框架的CA-override重排命令."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**OIDC JVM CA trust (self-signed TLS only):** when ``TLS_MODE == self_signed``, the backend command (in ``templates/compose.yml.j2``) imports the internal CA into a writable ``cacerts`` copy and points the JVM at it via ``JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS``. The shared ``with-ca-trust.sh`` entrypoint covers the OS/NSS/env trust stores but not the JVM truststore, so without this Penpot’s server-side OIDC token/userinfo calls to Keycloak fail with ``PKIX path building failed``. The override is gated behind self-signed mode (it is a no-op in production, where real CA-signed certs are already trusted) and the CA path is hardcoded because the framework’s CA-override re-serialises the command."
msgstr "**OIDC JVM CA信托基金 (仅自签名 TLS)数字 :** 何时 ``TLS_MODE == self_signed``, 后端命令 (内 ``templates/compose.yml.j2``) 将内部 CA 导入为可写 ``cacerts`` 复制并标注 JVM通过 ``JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS``. 共享 ``with-ca-trust.sh`` 进入点包括: OS/NSS/env 信托商店,但不是JVM信托, 所以没有这个 Penpot服务器侧 OIDC 令牌/用户信息呼叫 Keycloak 失败 ``PKIX path building failed``。该超载在自签名模式后加门 (已信任真实的 CA 签名证书, 这是生产中的禁用) 而 CA 路径是硬码的,因为框架的 CA 覆盖重排命令 。."

