# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys ejabberd on Docker Compose with the project's standard role-meta wiring. It binds ejabberd's `auth_method` to `svc-db-openldap` so XMPP clients authenticate against the project's central LDAP. The OIDC variant additionally loads `mod_oauth2_client` so a Keycloak-issued bearer token can be exchanged for an ejabberd session, but most XMPP clients still rely on SCRAM-SHA-256 over LDAP, which remains the interoperable default."
msgstr "这个角色在 Docker Compose 与项目的标准角色-meta线. 它会绑住ejabberd的 `auth_method` 改为: `svc-db-openldap` 这样 XMPP 客户端对项目中心LDAP进行认证. OIDC 变体加载 `mod_oauth2_client` 这样 Keycloak- 签发的无记名证书可以换成ejabberd会话,但大多数 XMPP 客户仍然依赖SCRAM-SHA...256 超过 LDAP,这仍然是互操作默认值。."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys ejabberd on Docker Compose with the project’s standard role-meta wiring. It binds ejabberd’s ``auth_method`` to ``svc-db-openldap`` so XMPP clients authenticate against the project’s central LDAP. The OIDC variant additionally loads ``mod_oauth2_client`` so a Keycloak-issued bearer token can be exchanged for an ejabberd session, but most XMPP clients still rely on SCRAM-SHA-256 over LDAP, which remains the interoperable default."
msgstr "这个角色在 Docker Compose 与项目的标准角色-meta接线. 它束缚着ejabberd的 ``auth_method`` 改为: ``svc-db-openldap`` 这样 XMPP 客户根据项目的中央LDAP进行认证。 OIDC 变体加载 ``mod_oauth2_client`` 这样 Keycloak- 签发的无记名证书可以换成ejabberd会话,但大多数 XMPP 客户仍然依赖SCRAM-SHA...256 超过 LDAP,这仍然是互操作默认值。."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys n8n Community Edition using the upstream ``docker.n8n.io/n8nio/n8n`` image backed by a PostgreSQL database (consumed from the central ``svc-db-postgres`` via ``sys-stk-full``). Authentication is handled by an **oauth2-proxy** sidecar (Keycloak OIDC) in V1, or left to n8n’s own user-management UI in V2. n8n Community Edition does not support LDAP — it is gated behind n8n’s Enterprise license (``ldap.controller.ee.js`` is not registered in CE) — so no LDAP variant is offered. Credentials stored inside n8n are encrypted at rest with a stable ``N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY``."
msgstr "此角色部署 n8n 使用上游的社区版 ``docker.n8n.io/n8nio/n8n`` 图像由一个 PostgreSQL 数据库 (从中央消耗 ``svc-db-postgres`` 通过 ``sys-stk-full``)。验证由 **欧斯2- 代号** 侧车 (Keycloak 奥伊德科) 第五编1,或左转至n8N 的用户管理工具2编号8n 社区版不支持 LDAP —— 它的门在 n 之后8企业执照 (``ldap.controller.ee.js`` 未在 CE 中注册) ——所以没有提供LDAP的变体. 证书储存在n之内8n 在休息时用一个稳定器加密 ``N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY``。 。 。."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys n8n Community Edition using the upstream `docker.n8n.io/n8nio/n8n` image backed by a PostgreSQL database (consumed from the central `svc-db-postgres` via `sys-stk-full`). Authentication is handled by an **oauth2-proxy** sidecar (Keycloak OIDC) in V1, or left to n8n's own user-management UI in V2. n8n Community Edition does not support LDAP — it is gated behind n8n's Enterprise license (`ldap.controller.ee.js` is not registered in CE) — so no LDAP variant is offered. Credentials stored inside n8n are encrypted at rest with a stable `N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY`."
msgstr "此角色部署 n8n 使用上游的社区版 `docker.n8n.io/n8nio/n8n` 图像由一个 PostgreSQL 数据库 (从中央消耗 `svc-db-postgres` 通过 `sys-stk-full`)。验证由 **欧斯2- 代号** 侧车 (Keycloak 奥伊德科) 第五编1,或左转至n8N 的用户管理 UI 在 V2编号8n 社区版不支持 LDAP —— 它的门在 n 之后8企业执照 (`ldap.controller.ee.js` 未在 CE 中注册) ——所以没有提供LDAP的变体. 证书储存在n之内8n 在休息时用一个稳定器加密 `N8N_ENCRYPTION_KEY`。 。 。."

