msgstr "WordPress的cononical表面是公共博客的头版. OIDC的往返火灾 ``/wp-login.php``,该 ``daggerhart-openid-connect-generic`` 添加自动方向 Keycloak (``login_type: auto``,参见 ```meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml`` <./meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml>`__); the shared personas enter at the site root and never visit that path. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The journeys themselves are not dropped: ``test-admin-oidc-login.js`` drives the admin login, logout and landing assertion, and ``test-rbac-roles.js`` 驱动器 Keycloak- 组对 -WordPress- 在同一个入口上画图."

